          "jcr:created": "Thu Jun 10 2021 19:03:05 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Key benefits</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Anatomically tailored: Adapts to arthritic anatomy, preserving subchondral bone<br>\n</li>\n<li>Uncommonly versatile: Offered in multiple backside curvatures<br>\n</li>\n<li>Minimally reamed: Removes up to 68% less bone than traditional systems<sup>1</sup><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jun 23 2021 17:56:52 GMT+0000",
