          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Key benefits</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Position: Restores height, version, and alignment<sup>2</sup></li>\n<li>Preparation: Designed for precision in every step<sup><br>\n </sup></li>\n<li>Preservation: Designed for less bone removal, providing more support<sup>3</sup></li>\n</ul>\n",
